        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="49" value="Simple Rules (No Fear of Math!):   •  1•X = X (stays same)     •  2•X = shift bits left by 1 (if leftmost bit was 1, XOR with 0x1B)     •  3•X = (2•X) ⊕ X     •  + = XOR (⊕)&lt;br&gt;Result: Changing ANY 1 byte in Col 0 spreads completely into ALL 4 output bytes (44, D5, 7D, 7F)!" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F5F7;strokeColor=#D0D5DD;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E2226;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
